    "body": "closes #40427\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\ndir.lua leaves previously-navigated directory buffers around. this is fine by default, but users need a simple way to opt out.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\n1. Respect `set hidden` (via `'bufhidden'`) as one way to make previously-navigated dir buffers from showing up.\r\n2. Document a one-liner to hide these buffers",
    "closed_at": "2026-06-27T18:08:29Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40453#discussion_r3486481947"
